### Why ShareAlike

This material is a derivative work of **The Kanban Guide** (May 2025), copyright
Orderly Disruption Limited and Daniel S. Vacanti, Inc., which is itself licensed
CC BY-SA 4.0. ShareAlike requires derivative works to be distributed under the same
license, so this content is licensed the same way.

### What that means for you

You may share and adapt this content, including commercially, provided you:

- **Give appropriate credit** — see the attribution notice below
- **Indicate if changes were made**
- **Distribute your adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0** as well

### Attribution notice

When redistributing or adapting this content, include a notice substantially as
follows:

