## 2. Scripts

**Licensed under the MIT License.**

This covers everything in `professional-kanban/scripts/`.

Creative Commons recommends against applying CC licenses to software, and the
scripts implement statistical methods — Monte Carlo sampling and nearest-rank
percentiles — rather than reproducing text from the source guides. They are
therefore released separately under MIT so they can be freely embedded in other
tools.

